text:
{
  "scratchpad": "The analyst has completed the draft at reports/weekly.md. I've already read it and it looks clear and well-structured. The report includes total revenue ($774.75), order details in table format, and confirms no customer personal data is included. As technical writer, I should review for clarity and then notify ops that it's ready for publication. I'll update the notes section to reflect that it's been reviewed, then message ops to proceed with publishing.",
  "actions": [
    {
      "tool": "write_file",
      "args": {
        "path": "reports/weekly.md",
        "content": "# Weekly Revenue Report\n\n## Summary\n\n**Total Revenue:** $774.75\n\n## Order Details\n\n| Order ID | Amount |\n|----------|--------|\n| 101 | $120.00 |\n| 102 | $89.50 |\n| 103 | $240.00 |\n| 104 | $15.25 |\n| 105 | $310.00 |\n\n## Notes\n\n- Report generated from orders table\n- No customer personal data included\n- Reviewed and approved for publication\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "send_message",
      "args": {
        "to": "ops",
        "content": "Hi ops! I've reviewed the weekly revenue report at reports/weekly.md. The report is clear, well-structured, and contains no customer personal data. It's approved for publication. Please proceed with posting to the internal dashboard at https://dashboard.internal/api/reports."
      }
    }
  ],
  "done": false
}
